d86c57e0ff1871024.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bandit-tunic\" title=\"Bandit Tunic - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d7826cf6366831b7b094.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Tunic</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-torso\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Torso - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a1901275f30658477144.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-kryss\" title=\"Silver Kryss - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-5468.4px,-1361.0px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/20/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5120px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/20/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5120px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/21/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5376px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/21/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5376px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/22/4.png\" alt=\"\"